*** On startup the utility logs its effective intervals once; the
*** out-of-range grace and scrape intervals appear clamped up to their
*** minimums.
include/wait_for_pattern_in_file.inc [telemetry: reporting to .*grace_interval=20s, scrape_interval=10s]

*** A zero grace interval is clamped up to its minimum, so no report is
*** written in the first few seconds.
include/read_file_to_var.inc

*** Waiting until the first telemetry report is written, which only
*** happens once the clamped grace interval has elapsed.
include/wait_for_pattern_in_file.inc [telemetry: wrote report]

*** A one-second scrape interval is clamped up to its minimum, so the
*** next report does not follow within a second: the set of report files
*** is unchanged a few seconds after the first one.
include/read_file_to_var.inc
